{
  "mod": {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 1766,
      "hub_id": 2401,
      "guid": "com.rcta.synapticrig",
      "name": "RCTA - Synaptic Rig [CODIW]",
      "slug": "rcta-synaptic-rig-codiw",
      "teaser": "[EARLY VERSION] The Synaptic Rig from Call of Duty : Infinite Warfare",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2401.png",
      "downloads": 3472,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<p><strong>[EARLY VERSION] - [EARLY VERSION] - [EARLY VERSION]</strong></p>\n<p>This is the first addition to my soon to release RCTA (Random Clothing to Adorn) series. This is also my first mod for Tarkov so WORK WITH ME HERE. The reason it says Alpha/Early Version everywhere is because I’m in the middle of adding LOTS of different skins and included the first version of the model I ported for feedback on which is preferred. Essentially, this mod will either be deleted at a later date or heavily updated. I’m uploading it now before I get burned out and just stop making Tarkov mods. <strong>Please give feedback in the comments on if you prefer the “C6” , or “Synaptic Rig” model.</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>RCTA - Synaptic Rig [CODIW]</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Mod Description</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Synaptic Rig T1 Outfit - The Synaptic Rig is ported from Call of Duty : Infinite Warfare’s multiplayer. I tried my absolute best to get the model as close as I could to match the EFT body while keeping the original models weights, style, look, and it took a VERY long time doing it.</li>\n<li>C6 Rig Outfit - The second try I gave making a clothing mod for Tarkov, took me 2 hours and threw it in-game and it actually looks REALLY good but why include this if this isn’t the cleaner version? For feedback! Please let me know if you prefer the C6 version more then the Synaptic Rig T1 version. Yes they are the same model but shaped very different.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mod Includes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Factory [Head] (BEAR/USEC)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Factory Glow [Head] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Factory [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Factory [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Market [Head] (BEAR/USEC)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Market Glow [Head] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Market [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Market [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Military Spec [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Military Spec [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Mercury [Head] (BEAR/USEC)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Mercury Glow [Head] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Mercury [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Synaptic Rig Mercury [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>C6 [Head] (BEAR/USEC)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>C6 [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>C6 [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Known Issues</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Glow Heads will appear much darker when in-shadow (Material Issue, fixing soon hopefully)</li>\n<li>Head clips through everything, new heads coming soon (Should I make a squished version?)</li>\n<li>Brokey Icons (No idea how to start fixing that yet)</li>\n<li>Updating may corrupt profiles if the update changes already bought/worn head/clothes</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Recommended Mods</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1788-wtt-head-and-voice-selector/?highlight=voice#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Head and Voice Selector</a> - so you can, you know, select the heads</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Future Updates</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>12 New top skins</li>\n<li>12 New bottom skins</li>\n<li>12 New head skins</li>\n<li>Give proper names to everything</li>\n<li>Probably just remove the c6 version as the new one looks epic epic epic</li>\n<li>Change bundle directories so they’re not in the same files as WTT projects</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Support</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check out my other work on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TRAPPUSSY\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.patreon.com/TRAPPUSSY</a></li>\n<li>Donate or maybe look into commissions on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/trappucci\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/trappucci</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Credits</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fortnite,</li>\n<li>GrooveypenguinX for Almost Everything</li>\n<li>DrakiaXYZ for letting me know how cancerous the previous file host I used was LOL</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Media</strong></p>\n",
